      "description": "Watch KVC Westerlo vs Union St. Gilloise highlights and goals from Jupiler Pro League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 10, 2026. Expectations were high as two determined sides took to the pitch for a crucial Jupiler Pro League fixture. On August 10, 2026 , the stadium played host to an encounter defined by high energy and tactical adjustments that kept the outcome uncertain until the final whistle. Opening Exchanges The game ignited early, with both teams looking to assert their dominance. It was KVC Westerlo who drew first blood when Norman Bassette found the target in the 13th minute, set up beautifully by Isa Sakamoto . The lead did not deflate the visitors, as Union St. Gilloise ramped up the pressure. Their persistence paid off in the 28th minute when Promise David , following an assist from Besfort Zeneli , leveled the score, marking the beginning of a fierce battle in the middle of the park. Second Half Momentum Following the break, both managers turned to their benches to shift the tactical balance. The game opened up as the substitutes began to make their impact felt on the pitch. Raul Florucz nudged the visitors ahead in the 57th minute, assisted by Promise David , before Relebohile Mofokeng doubled that advantage shortly after the hour mark. As the clock wound down, the intensity peaked with Guilherme Smith and Darius Olaru finding the net in a flurry of late action, capping off an enthralling match of football."
